@startuml
' Gallery: boxes around participants, numbered messages and page texts
header Draft
title Payment flow
autonumber
box "Front end" #LightBlue
  participant Browser
  participant App
end box
box "Back end" #MistyRose
  participant Api
  participant Bank
end box
Browser -> App : pay
App -> Api : charge
Api -> Bank : authorize
Bank --> Api : approved
Api --> App : paid
App --> Browser : receipt
legend right
  Numbers show the order of the messages
endlegend
footer Page 1
@enduml
